    <!-- Setup -->
    <string name="safety">Ride safe: set everything up before you ride. Use voice and big buttons only, keep your eyes on the road and follow local traffic laws.</string>
    <string name="h_mode">1. What is this phone?</string>
    <string name="mode_standalone">Standalone screen (recommended) – works on its own using your main phone\'s hotspot. Nothing to install on the main phone.</string>
    <string name="standalone_help">Standalone setup:\n• Turn on your main phone\'s hotspot and connect this phone to it.\n• WhatsApp on this phone → Link as companion device (WhatsApp → Linked devices on your main phone).\n• Google Messages on this phone → Device pairing, to see SMS.\n• Samsung phones: try \"Call &amp; text on other devices\" on both phones for calls.\n• Otherwise answer calls with your car or helmet Bluetooth.</string>
    <string name="h_layout">Screen layout</string>
