    <string name="h_link">3. Secure pairing of the two phones</string>
    <string name="link_help">All data between the phones is encrypted, and only the phone you pair here is accepted.\n\n1. Pair both phones in Bluetooth settings.\n2. On the BIKE phone tap \"Start pairing\".\n3. On the MAIN phone choose the bike phone, then tap \"Pair with bike phone\".\n4. Both phones show a 6-digit code. Tap MATCH only if the codes are the same.\n\nSkip this if the old phone has its own SIM.</string>
